<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>[Il Tuo Nome] | Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0b12;
            --secondary-bg: #151521;
            --card-bg: rgba(25, 25, 40, 0.85);

            --text-color: #f5f5ff;
            --text-muted: #b1b1c9;

            --accent-color: #8b5cf6;
            --accent-light: #a855f7;

            --border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);

            --shadow-purple:
                0 0 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4),
                0 0 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);

            --max-width: 900px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12), transparent 30%),
                var(--bg-color);

            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: var(--max-width);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.8);
        }

        .hero {
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero span {
            color: var(--accent-light);
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.8);
        }

        .hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            max-width: 650px;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: white;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        @media (min-width: 700px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 1.5rem;

            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

            transition: 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15),
                transparent
            );
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-purple);
            border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
        }

        .card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            color: #d8b4fe;

            padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 999px;

            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        .project-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--accent-light);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .project-link:hover {
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.9);
        }

        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;

            font-weight: 600;

            transition: 0.3s ease;

            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 12px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35),
                inset 0 0 12px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                #7c3aed,
                #a855f7
            );

            color: white;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            color: white;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 20px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.7),
                0 0 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
        }

        .about-text {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .about-text p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 5rem;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);

            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);

            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 0.7rem;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.3rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">[TUO NOME]</a>

        <nav>
            <a href="#projects">Progetti</a>
            <a href="#about">Chi Sono</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contatti</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>

        <section class="hero">
            <h1>
                Ciao, sono <span>[Il Tuo Nome]</span> 👋
            </h1>

            <p>
                Creo esperienze digitali moderne, eleganti e minimaliste.
                Sviluppo siti web e progetti con uno stile futuristico,
                performance elevate e design accattivante.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">

            <h2>⚡ Progetti In Evidenza</h2>

            <div class="grid">

                <div class="card">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Portfolio Premium</h3>

                        <p>
                            Un portfolio moderno con tema cyber viola/nero,
                            animazioni fluide e design responsive.
                        </p>

                        <div class="tags">
                            <span class="tag">HTML</span>
                            <span class="tag">CSS</span>
                            <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <a href="#" class="project-link">
                        Vedi Progetto →
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Dashboard AI</h3>

                        <p>
                            Dashboard elegante per strumenti AI con effetti glow,
                            dark UI e componenti interattivi.
                        </p>

                        <div class="tags">
                            <span class="tag">React</span>
                            <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <a href="#" class="project-link">
                        Vedi Progetto →
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about">

            <h2>🧠 Chi Sono</h2>

            <div class="about-text">
                <p>
                    Sono uno sviluppatore appassionato di UI futuristiche,
                    automazioni e progetti creativi.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Mi piace creare esperienze moderne con colori neon,
                    animazioni fluide e design minimalista.
                </p>
            </div>

        </section>

        <section id="contact">

            <h2>🚀 Iniziamo a Collaborare</h2>

            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                Hai un progetto in mente? Scrivimi.
            </p>

            <div class="contact-links">

                <a href="mailto:tuaemail@email.com"
                   class="btn btn-primary">
                    Invia un'Email
                </a>

                <a href="#"
                   class="btn btn-secondary">
                    GitHub
                </a>

                <a href="#"
                   class="btn btn-secondary">
                    LinkedIn
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>
            © <span id="year"></span> [Il Tuo Nome] — All Rights Reserved
        </p>
    </footer>

</div>

<script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
        new Date().getFullYear();
</script>

</body>
</html>